abstract: >-
  Part II of The Spacetime–Electromagnetic Framework: the field dynamics of the interior shift of Part I, a Clifford transport between its two readings, and one chiral Pati–Salam family on the full spinor module of the second rung, with the analysis of the mass field and an explicit obstruction to a restricted mass relation. Preprint, with a computational verification package. Manuscript and documentation under CC BY 4.0; verification software under MIT (see LICENSE.md).
