  - split-signature Clifford algebras
  - curl realisation of Maxwell evolution
  - massive two-form fields
  - tree unitarity
  - Clifford transport
  - commutants of Lorentz algebras
  - Pati-Salam models
  - electroweak symmetry breaking
  - fermion mass relations
  - vacuum alignment
  - computer-assisted algebra
